WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:12.180
As a final question, can you tell me what sorts of feelings you have for your former teammates and for the institution.

2
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.820
The highest.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:19.640
You know, as you know, we had the big 100-year centennial meeting this spring.

4
00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:23.480
That was great, that brought us all back together again and . . . You know,

5
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:29.800
the team, Scott, is more than just the lettermen, you know.

6
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.580
That needs to be mentioned, because there were those, you know,

7
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:42.820
that made up the difference between thirty-three or so who played and eighty or ninety who were on the team and never made it or made it in later years,

8
00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:47.820
okay, who were all part of it, okay, and a necessary part.
